{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260614194244f78a4d5b8d8d4f55","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the codebase. Let me create a task list and then start implementing Story 4: Fork as New Thread.\n\nBased on my analysis:\n\n1. The story requires implementing fork detection and seeding functionality\n2. Key files to work with:\n   - `src/lifecycle/fork.ts` - currently has NotImplementedError stubs\n   - Need to create `test/lifecycle/fork.test.ts` - doesn't exist yet\n\n3. The implementation needs to:\n   - Detect fork from `session_before_fork` hook (with PI session tree as Epic-1 fallback)\n   - Create a new thread for the fork\n   - Seed the new thread by replaying source events up to the fork point\n   - Ensure source thread receives no writes (verified by logical read-back equality)\n   - Derived forms should requeue (not copy) in v1\n\n4. Dependencies:\n   - Story 2 for replayable capture (converter, map-message, turn-accumulator)\n   - Story 1 for new thread creation and thread resolution\n   - LHC SDK's threads, intakeStream, inspect APIs\n\nLet me create a task list and start implementation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4d7a60a-ad74-449d-9e1f-59d73cd3f78b","uuid":"a5a715f7-6d4d-427f-bfbb-f79e82b136c7"}
